ployment ends for any reason other t","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":6},{"index":30,"text":"The parent-employee becomes entitled to Medicare benefits (P","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":6},{"index":31,"text":"The parents become divorced or legally separated; or","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":6},{"index":32,"text":"The child stops being eligible for coverage under the Plan a","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":6},{"index":33,"text":"When is COBRA continuation coverage available?","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"Heading3","style_name":"heading 3","format":5,"font":3},{"index":34,"text":"The Plan will offer COBRA continuation coverage to qualified","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"Normal","style_name":"Normal","format":2,"font":6},{"index":35,"text":"The end of employment or reduction of hours of employment;","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":6},{"index":36,"text":"Death of the employee;","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":6},{"index":37,"text":"[add if Plan provides retiree health coverage:  Commencement","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":8},{"index":38,"text":"The employee’s becoming entitled to Medicare benefits (under","style_builtin":true,"style_id":"ListParagraph","style_name":"List Paragraph","format":4,"list_string":"","list_level":1,"font":6},{"index":39,"text":"For all other qualifying events (divo